","sm":"filigā,"},{"en":"·","sm":"ma"},{"en":"·","sm":"lou"},{"en":"and thy patience","sm":"onosai"},{"en":"·","sm":"ma"},{"en":"·","sm":"lou"},{"en":"and thy long-suffering","sm":"tali-tiga"},{"en":"·","sm":"i"},{"en":"·","sm":"totonu"},{"en":"among","sm":"o"},{"en":"·","sm":"tagata"},{"en":"·","sm":"sa"},{"en":"the people of the Zoramites.","sm":"Soramā."}]},{"en":"For I know that thou wast in bonds; yea, and I also know that thou wast stoned for the word's sake; and thou didst bear all these things with patience because the Lord was with thee; and now thou knowest that the Lord did deliver thee.","n":4,"sm":"Ona ua ou iloa sa e i ai i noanoaga; ioe, ma ua ou iloa foi sa fetogi oe i maa ona o ana afioga; ma sa e talitalia nei mea uma ma le onosai ona sa faatasi le Alii ma oe; ma o lenei ua e iloa o le Alii na lavea’iina oe.","w":[{"en":"For","sm":"Ona"},{"en":"·","sm":"ua"},{"en":"·","sm":"ou"},{"en":"I know","sm":"iloa"},{"en":"·","sm":"sa"},{"en":"·","sm":"e"},{"en":"·","sm":"i"},{"en":"that thou wast","sm":"ai"},{"en":"·","sm":"i"},{"en":"in bonds;","sm":"noanoaga;"},{"en":"yea,","sm":"ioe,"},{"en":"·","sm":"ma"},{"en":"·","sm":"ua"},{"en":"·","sm":"ou"},{"en":"·","sm":"iloa"},{"en":"and I also know","sm":"foi"},{"en":"·","sm":"sa"},{"en":"·","sm":"fetogi"},{"en":"·","sm":"oe"},{"en":"·","sm":"i"},{"en":"that thou wast stoned","sm":"maa"},{"en":"·","sm":"ona"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"·","sm":"ana"},{"en":"for the word's sake;","sm":"afioga;"},{"en":"·","sm":"ma"},{"en":"·","sm":"sa"},{"en":"·","sm":"e"},{"en":"and thou didst bear","sm":"talitalia"},{"en":"·","sm":"nei"},{"en":"·","sm":"mea"},{"en":"all these things","sm":"uma"},{"en":"·","sm":"ma"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"with patience","sm":"onosai"},{"en":"because","sm":"ona"},{"en":"·","sm":"sa"},{"en":"·","sm":"faatasi"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"the Lord was","sm":"Alii"},{"en":"·","sm":"ma"},{"en":"with thee;","sm":"oe;"},{"en":"·","sm":"ma"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"and now","sm":"lenei"},{"en