"a’e"},{"en":"and thou shalt be lifted up","sm":"oe"},{"en":"·","sm":"i"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"·","sm":"aso"},{"en":"at the last day.","sm":"gataaga."}]},{"en":"Now, my son, I would not that ye should think that I know these things of myself, but it is the Spirit of God which is in me which maketh these things known unto me; for if I had not been born of God I should not have known these things.","n":6,"sm":"O lenei, lo’u atalii e, ou te le manao ia e manatu e faapea ua ou iloa nei mea e a’u lava ia, ae o le Agaga o le Atua ua i totonu ia te a’u na ia faailoa mai ia nei mea ia te a’u; a na le fanauina a’u i la le Atua, po ua ou le iloaina nei mea.","w":[{"en":"·","sm":"O"},{"en":"Now,","sm":"lenei,"},{"en":"·","sm":"lo’u"},{"en":"·","sm":"atalii"},{"en":"my son,","sm":"e,"},{"en":"·","sm":"ou"},{"en":"·","sm":"te"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"I would not","sm":"manao"},{"en":"·","sm":"ia"},{"en":"·","sm":"e"},{"en":"that ye should think","sm":"manatu"},{"en":"·","sm":"e"},{"en":"that","sm":"faapea"},{"en":"·","sm":"ua"},{"en":"·","sm":"ou"},{"en":"·","sm":"iloa"},{"en":"·","sm":"nei"},{"en":"I know these things","sm":"mea"},{"en":"·","sm":"e"},{"en":"·","sm":"a’u"},{"en":"·","sm":"lava"},{"en":"of myself,","sm":"ia,"},{"en":"·","sm":"ae"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"·","sm":"Agaga"},{"en":"but the Spirit of","sm":"o"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"God","sm":"Atua"},{"en":"·","sm":"ua"},{"en":"·","sm":"i"},{"en":"·","sm":"totonu"},{"en":"·","sm":"ia"},{"en":"·","sm":"te"},{"en":"which is in me","sm":"a’u"},{"en":"·","sm":"na"},{"en":"·","sm":"ia"},{"en":"·","sm":"faailoa"},{"en":"·","sm":"mai"},{"en":"which maketh known","sm":"ia"},{"en":"·","sm":"nei"},{"en":"these things","sm":"mea"},{"en":"·","sm":"ia"},{"en":"·","sm":"te"},{"en":"unto me;","sm":"a’u;"},{"en":"·","sm":"a"},{"en":"·","sm":"na"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"·","sm":"fanauina"},{"en":"for if I had not been born","sm":"a’u"},{"en":"·","sm":"i"},{"en":"·","sm":"la"},{"en":"·","s